  <Properties>
    <metaDescription>
      <Value><![CDATA[3chillies are thrilled to announce that we’ve formally been accepted into the G-Cloud 14 framework which will help us continue to provide services to the UK public sector.]]></Value>
    </metaDescription>
    <metaTitle>
      <Value><![CDATA[3chillies continues to support the UK public sector with a G-Cloud 14 listing]]></Value>
    </metaTitle>
    <openGraphImage>
      <Value><![CDATA[]]></Value>
    </openGraphImage>
    <pageContent>
      <Value><![CDATA[{
  "contentData": [
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "a58b29f0-29c6-47b8-b8ce-329b38fbed3c",
      "key": "97ce4e03-3a92-4117-bfec-986085f298d7",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "text",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "Layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cdiv class=\u0022component-inner\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022info\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022text base-text\u0022 data-os-animation=\u0022fadeIn\u0022 data-os-animation-delay=\u00220s\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOver the past few years 3chillies are proud to have been involved in some major digital projects for public sector and government organisations. We\u2019ve worked with some very well-known clients (which we\u2019re unfortunately not allowed to tell you about) and we continue to support them.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWe\u2019re thrilled to announce that we\u2019ve formally been accepted into the G-Cloud 14 framework which will help us continue to provide services to the UK public sector.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EG-Cloud 14 is an official UK-government managed supplier list that helps public sector organisations to procure expert help for\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003Ecloud hosting services\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003Ecloud software services\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003Eassociated support services.\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWe\u2019ve been listed on predecessor versions of the framework including G-Cloud 12 and G-Cloud 13 as well as the related Digital Outcomes 6, which lists a wider range of services relating to digital and outsourcing projects.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOn our listings our services relating to two areas are listed:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003Esoftware development and cloud migration services\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003Ewebsite, app \u0026amp; API hosting, support and maintenance.\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFrameworks like G-Cloud 14 play a pivotal role in driving innovation across the public sector, and also help to save precious time in procuring services (and therefore taxpayer\u2019s money).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOf course, they have helped us to build up our services to the public sector, and we look forward to continuing working with some great people at amazing clients.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIf you\u2019d like to discuss more about G-Cloud framework, then \u003Ca href=\u0022/contact/\u0022 title=\u0022Contact\u0022\u003Eget in touch!\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "settingsData": [
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "47b7548d-92f8-4a3d-a632-0b495b62b3ff",
